  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Now let's understand the question.",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 1700,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 51,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "We are given an array, and every value is only one of these three numbers, 0, 1, or 2.",
      "start_ms": 2460,
      "end_ms": 11120,
      "start_frame": 74,
      "end_frame": 334,
      "word_count": 19
    },
    {
      "text": "Our job is to arrange the same array, so that all zeros come first, then all ones, and finally all twos.",
      "start_ms": 11960,
      "end_ms": 19660,
      "start_frame": 359,
      "end_frame": 590,
      "word_count": 21
    },
    {
      "text": "For this lesson, we will use one master example.",
      "start_ms": 20180,
      "end_ms": 22880,
      "start_frame": 605,
      "end_frame": 686,
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "Two?",
      "start_ms": 23080,
      "end_ms": 23400,
      "start_frame": 692,
      "end_frame": 702,
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "One.",
      "start_ms": 23840,
      "end_ms": 24260,
      "start_frame": 715,
      "end_frame": 728,
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "Two.",
      "start_ms": 24520,
      "end_ms": 24920,
      "start_frame": 736,
      "end_frame": 748,
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "Zero.",
      "start_ms": 25320,
      "end_ms": 25660,
      "start_frame": 760,
      "end_frame": 770,
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "Two.",
      "start_ms": 26160,
      "end_ms": 26440,
      "start_frame": 785,
      "end_frame": 793,
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "One.",
      "start_ms": 26940,
      "end_ms": 27220,
      "start_frame": 808,
      "end_frame": 817,
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "Zero.",
      "start_ms": 27560,
      "end_ms": 27960,
      "start_frame": 827,
      "end_frame": 839,
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "One.",
      "start_ms": 28400,
      "end_ms": 28700,
      "start_frame": 852,
      "end_frame": 861,
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "Zero.",
      "start_ms": 29020,
      "end_ms": 29520,
      "start_frame": 871,
      "end_frame": 886,
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "Two.",
      "start_ms": 29520,
      "end_ms": 30120,
      "start_frame": 886,
      "end_frame": 904,
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "We want this array to become 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 2, 2, 2, 2.",
      "start_ms": 30560,
      "end_ms": 38660,
      "start_frame": 917,
      "end_frame": 1160,
      "word_count": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "There are two important conditions.",
      "start_ms": 38980,
      "end_ms": 40560,
      "start_frame": 1169,
      "end_frame": 1217,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "First, we have to modify the same array.",
      "start_ms": 41060,
      "end_ms": 44160,
      "start_frame": 1232,
      "end_frame": 1325,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "Second, we should not use a built -in sorting function.",
      "start_ms": 45000,
      "end_ms": 48900,
      "start_frame": 1350,
      "end_frame": 1467,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "And then comes the follow -up.",
      "start_ms": 49540,
      "end_ms": 51280,
      "start_frame": 1486,
      "end_frame": 1538,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "Can we solve it in one pass using constant extra space?",
      "start_ms": 51680,
      "end_ms": 56300,
      "start_frame": 1550,
      "end_frame": 1689,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "That is the real challenge of this problem.",
      "start_ms": 57300,
      "end_ms": 60360,
      "start_frame": 1719,
      "end_frame": 1811,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "One more important observation.",
      "start_ms": 61340,
      "end_ms": 63760,
      "start_frame": 1840,
      "end_frame": 1913,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "The array can contain only three possible values.",
      "start_ms": 64680,
      "end_ms": 68700,
      "start_frame": 1940,
      "end_frame": 2061,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "That small detail is the main clue.",
      "start_ms": 69520,
      "end_ms": 72300,
      "start_frame": 2086,
      "end_frame": 2169,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Now, we can start with the simpler approach first.",
      "start_ms": 73340,
      "end_ms": 77420,
      "start_frame": 2200,
      "end_frame": 2323,
      "word_count": 9
    }
  ],
